#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0280B expect=skipped domain=ADXX
#note "Structure declared, subclass NOT declared; no AETERM/AEDECOD so columns can't detect ADVERSE EVENT either. Scope.Subclasses.Include requires a POSITIVELY detected subclass -> plain OCCDS with none is skipped before executing. THE BATCH'S SINGLE PIN on the [OCCDS]+[ADVERSE EVENT] block shared by AD0280B/AD0281B/AD0287B/AD0288B/AD0293B/AD0294B/AD0310B/AD0311B, and the DISCRIMINATING fixture for finding AD0280B-F1 (M2-Q1 face B). NEVER re-aim."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADXX structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEV   type=Char
col AESEVN  type=Num
---
